AltoMintMarket::liquidate()
├── when market is paused
│   └── it should revert
├── given position is solvent
│   └── it should revert with DlbDcfPriorityLiquidationEngineLiquidatingSolventPosition
├── given liquidator identity forwarding
│   ├── when caller is not authorized liquidation periphery
│   │   ├── when liquidationData is empty
│   │   │   └── it should pass msg.sender to liquidation engine as liquidator
│   │   └── when liquidationData is abi.encode(spoofedLiquidator, innerLiquidationData)
│   │       ├── it should pass msg.sender to liquidation engine as liquidator
│   │       ├── it should pass the full encoded bytes to liquidation engine as liquidationData
│   │       └── it should not grant priority-liquidator privileges to spoofedLiquidator
│   └── when caller is authorized liquidation periphery
│       ├── when liquidationData is not valid abi.encode(address, bytes)
│       │   └── it should revert on abi.decode
│       └── when liquidationData is abi.encode(originalLiquidator, originalLiquidationData)
│           ├── when originalLiquidator is zero address
│           │   └── it should revert with AltoBaseMarketInvalidInput
│           ├── it should pass originalLiquidator to liquidation engine as liquidator
│           ├── it should pass originalLiquidationData to liquidation engine as liquidationData
│           └── it should emit Liquidation event with originalLiquidator and borrower
├── given position is insolvent
│   ├── given claimableFeesAssets is greater than zero
│   │   ├── it should claim interest before liquidate
│   │   ├── it should mint claimableFeesAssets to feeRecipient
│   │   ├── it should set claimableFeesAssets to zero
│   │   └── it should emit InterestClaimed event
│   ├── given claimableFeesAssets is zero
│   │   └── it should not claim interest
│   ├── when priority liquidation is enabled
│   │   ├── when current LTV is below disable priority liquidation threshold
│   │   │   ├── when liquidator is not priority liquidator
│   │   │   │   ├── when position is not tagged
│   │   │   │   │   └── it should revert with DlbDcfPriorityLiquidationEngineLiquidationUnauthorized
│   │   │   │   └── when position is tagged
│   │   │   │       ├── when liquidationWindowTag has elapsed since tag was set
│   │   │   │       │   └── it should revert with DlbDcfPriorityLiquidationEngineLiquidationUnauthorized
│   │   │   │       └── when liquidationWindowTag has not elapsed since tag was set
│   │   │   │           ├── when liquidator is the tagger
│   │   │   │           │   ├── when priority liquidation grace period has not elapsed
│   │   │   │           │   │   └── it should revert with DlbDcfPriorityLiquidationEngineLiquidationUnauthorized
│   │   │   │           │   └── when priority liquidation grace period has elapsed
│   │   │   │           │       └── it should proceed with liquidation
│   │   │   │           └── when liquidator is not the tagger
│   │   │   │               ├── when combined grace periods have not elapsed
│   │   │   │               │   └── it should revert with DlbDcfPriorityLiquidationEngineLiquidationUnauthorized
│   │   │   │               └── when combined grace periods have elapsed
│   │   │   │                   └── it should proceed with liquidation
│   │   │   └── when liquidator is priority liquidator
│   │   │       └── it should proceed with liquidation
│   │   └── when current LTV is above disable priority liquidation threshold
│   │       └── it should proceed with liquidation
│   └── when priority liquidation is disabled
│       └── it should proceed with liquidation
├── given liquidation proceeds
│   ├── it should calculate liquidation fee based on liquidator type
│   ├── it should calculate liquidation percentage
│   ├── it should calculate new LTV target
│   ├── it should calculate collateral to sell
│   └── it should calculate final amounts
├── given share calculations
│   ├── when repay shares exceed user borrow shares
│   │   ├── when difference is less than VIRTUAL_SHARES
│   │   │   └── it should cap repay shares to user borrow shares
│   │   └── when difference is greater than or equal to VIRTUAL_SHARES
│   │       └── it should use calculated repay shares
│   └── when repay shares do not exceed user borrow shares
│       └── it should use calculated repay shares
├── given liquidation state updates
│   ├── it should decrease borrower collateral assets
│   ├── it should decrease borrower borrow shares
│   ├── it should decrease total borrowed shares
│   ├── it should decrease total borrowed assets
│   └── when priority liquidation is enabled and current LTV is below threshold
│       └── it should delete liquidable position
├── given bad debt handling
│   ├── when borrower has no collateral remaining
│   │   ├── it should calculate bad debt shares
│   │   ├── it should calculate bad debt assets
│   │   ├── it should apply bad debt to market
│   │   └── it should reset borrower borrow shares to zero
│   └── when borrower has collateral remaining
│       └── it should not apply bad debt
├── given token transfers
│   ├── it should transfer collateral tokens to msg.sender
│   ├── it should transfer borrow tokens from msg.sender to market
│   └── when callback data is provided
│       ├── it should call onLiquidateCallback on msg.sender
│       └── it should pass collateral amount and data
├── given event emission
│   ├── when caller is direct liquidator
│   │   └── it should emit Liquidation event with borrower and originalLiquidator
│   └── when caller is authorized liquidation periphery
│       └── it should emit Liquidation event with borrower and forwarded originalLiquidator
└── given function completion
    └── it should return collateral amount and repay amount
